      "contentHtml": "<div class=\"payload-richtext\"><p>This is the first <strong>test</strong> post on the production CMS at <a href=\"https://cms.qkenn.cloud\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cms.qkenn.cloud</a>.</p><h2>What&#39;s in the stack</h2><ul class=\"list-bullet\"><li\n          class=\"\"\n          style=\"\"\n          value=\"1\"\n        >Payload CMS 3.90 running in Docker on the VPS</li><li\n          class=\"\"\n          style=\"\"\n          value=\"2\"\n        >Postgres 16 for content, images on Cloudflare R2</li><li\n          class=\"\"\n          style=\"\"\n          value=\"3\"\n        >The blog is a static Astro site, rebuilt on every publish</li></ul><h3>Publishing flow</h3><p>Write → <strong>Publish</strong> → GitHub Actions rebuilds the site → the post is live in about <em>1–2 minutes</em>.</p><blockquote>Readers only download static HTML, so the blog stays up even if the CMS is down.</blockquote></div>"
